Adventurer,

As summer turns slowly to autumn in Albion, shepherding season is just begi=
nning. And those unflagging farmers out there have another chance to get an=
 able assistant to their work. Yes, a new *referral season* ( https://albio=
nonline.com/news/referral-september-2023 ) is upon us, and you can get your=
self a *Sheepdog* with just one referral!

( https://albiononline.com/news/referral-september-2023 )

This skin for your *Direwolf* base mount proves that you can be smart, hard=
-working, and cute all at once, and its thick fur and drooping tongue make =
it beloved by even the most hard-hearted warrior. Once the skin is unlocked=
, it can be used by any of your characters on that particular server (eithe=
r *Albion East* or *West* ).

This Referral Season lasts until *23:59:59 UTC* on *September 30* , so invi=
te your friends and enjoy these rewards!

The Heretic Challenge Returns
-----------------------------

The chill of fall is beginning to creep into the air... and the *Heretic Ch=
allenge* ( https://albiononline.com/news/heretic-challenge-2023 ) is back! =
For the entire month of September, earn points for open-world activities, u=
nlock chests to get valuable loot, and claim your very own *Heretic Combat =
Mule*.

( https://albiononline.com/news/heretic-challenge-2023 )

As always, you can earn Challenge Points by gathering, fishing, farming, an=
d killing monsters. Points count simultaneously toward a daily bonus, a wee=
kly unlockable chest, and the monthly mount and avatar ring rewards. So log=
 in, head out into the open world, gather points, and claim these rewards w=
hile they last!

Join the Subreddit for a Fame Rush!
-----------------------------------

